  "description": "A unified interface for multi-cloud storage operations. StorageConnector provides a consistent abstraction layer for Azure Blob Storage, AWS S3, and Google Cloud Storage, with pre-signed upload and download URLs, country-based account routing, and an optional face recognition API with explicit biometric erasure.",
  "id": "StorageConnector",
  "isPrerelease": false,
